---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Rachel Bakker — The Makers Collective | Waiheke Island Art"
  description="Rachel Bakker is a painter with The Makers Collective, working from Waiheke Island, New Zealand."
>
  <section class="wrap artist">
    <h1>Rachel Bakker</h1>
    <p>
      Rachel Bakker paints the way the tide moves — slowly, then all at once.
      Working mostly in oil and cold-pressed watercolour, she spends early
      mornings on Waiheke's western bays, watching how light shifts across
      water before she ever picks up a brush. Her canvases build in thin,
      repeated layers, a process she describes as "listening to the same
      view until it says something new."
    </p>
    <p>
      Rachel trained initially as a printmaker in Auckland before moving to
      the island full-time in 2015, and that print background still shows in
      her palette — flat, considered fields of colour rather than blended
      gradients. She works in long, uninterrupted stretches, often finishing
      only one or two paintings a month, and rarely titles a piece until
      it's completely dry.
    </p>
    <p>
      Her work has shown in small group exhibitions around Auckland and
      Waiheke, but she's said more than once that she paints primarily for
      the process, not the audience. When she isn't painting, Rachel
      free-dives along the coastline near her studio, and much of the
      colour and movement in her recent work traces directly back to what
      she's seen underwater that week. She lives with her partner and an
      elderly whippet in a converted boatshed near Rocky Bay.
    </p>
    <a href="/gallery" class="btn">View available work</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .artist { padding: 4rem 0 5rem; max-width: 58ch; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
  .artist h1 { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .artist p { text-align: left; }
  .artist .btn { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
